---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact My Lab Tests"
  description="Report a wrong price, ask a question, or send a data or removal request."
  path="/contact/"
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Contact', path: '/contact/' }]}
>
  <div class="prose-tight max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold sm:text-3xl">Contact</h1>
    <p>
      Spotted a price that doesn't match the lab's site? That's the most useful
      mail you can send us. Include the page link and a screenshot if you can.
    </p>
    <p class="card">
      <strong>Email:</strong> hello@mylabtests.in<br />
      <span class="text-sm text-ink-soft">
        We reply within one working day. Corrections to live data usually ship
        the same day.
      </span>
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">For labs and brands</h2>
    <p>
      Data disputes, factual corrections and removal requests go to the same
      address with the subject "Data request". Tell us the exact page and what's
      wrong; verified issues are corrected or removed promptly.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">
      We can't answer medical questions, for anything about your health or
      your report, please talk to a doctor.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
